---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Compliance & Standards" description="WHS-compliant cleaning, risk mitigation, quality assurance, and audit reporting tailored to your business.">

<main>

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-primary text-white">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10">
    <div class="mb-kenburns absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center" style="background-image:url('/assets/compliance-facility.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#192e47e6] via-[#192e47bf] to-[#192e4766]"></div>
    <div class="mb-grid-overlay absolute inset-0 opacity-40"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 pb-24 pt-40 lg:px-10 lg:pb-32 lg:pt-48">
    <div class="mb-fade">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-white/70">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white">Home</a><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="9 18 15 12 9 6"/></svg><span class="text-white">Compliance & Standards</span>
      </nav>
      <p class="mt-8 text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.42em] text-white/70">Pillar 01 — Trust</p>
      <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-semibold leading-[1.05] tracking-tight text-white md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl">Compliance & Standards</h1>
      <div class="mt-10 h-px w-24 bg-white/40"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-background py-24 lg:py-32">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-16 px-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:px-10">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5 mb-fade">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.42em] text-accent">Our approach</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-primary md:text-4xl">Unwavering commitment to systemic benchmarks.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground/80 lg:col-span-7 mb-fade" data-delay="100">
      <p>Our approach to work, health, and safety requires an unwavering commitment to providing our workforce with the skills and tools necessary to meet systemic benchmarks; these guiding principles ensure full compliance and the highest standards of cleanliness. Millbrooke's personnel and partners play vital roles in daily workplace operations, effectively mitigating risks and delivering solutions whilst promoting safe working behaviour and quality assurance.</p>
      <p>Individualised processes and procedures from site inspections, to reporting and audit assessments, every aspect is tailored to your business's needs to measure and continually improve performance. Millbrooke promotes a culture of transparency, with feedback encouraged and flowing all ways, generating more meaningful engagement between both management and staff in order to uphold high standards and accountability.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="bg-card py-24 lg:py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 lg:px-10">
    <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
      <article class="group h-full border-t border-primary/20 pt-6 mb-fade" data-delay="0">
        <span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-white transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-1"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5-3.5 9-8 10-4.5-1-8-5-8-10V6z"/><polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"/></svg></span>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">WHS Compliant</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/70">Workforce equipped with skills and tools to meet systemic benchmarks.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="group h-full border-t border-primary/20 pt-6 mb-fade" data-delay="80">
        <span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-white transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-1"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg></span>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Risk Mitigation</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/70">Promoting safe working behaviour across every site we touch.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="group h-full border-t border-primary/20 pt-6 mb-fade" data-delay="160">
        <span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-white transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-1"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="4" width="12" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M9 4V2h6v2"/><polyline points="9 14 11 16 15 12"/></svg></span>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Quality Assurance</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/70">Individualised inspections, reporting and audit assessments.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="group h-full border-t border-primary/20 pt-6 mb-fade" data-delay="240">
        <span class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-white transition-transform group-hover:-translate-y-1"><svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 11.5a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9 3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1-7.6 4.7 8.4 8.4 0 0 1-3.8-.9L3 21l1.9-5.7a8.4 8.4 0 0 1-.9-3.8 8.5 8.5 0 0 1 4.7-7.6 8.4 8.4 0 0 1 3.8-.9h.5a8.5 8.5 0 0 1 8 8z"/></svg></span>
        <h3 class="mt-6 text-base font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Transparent Culture</h3>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-foreground/70">Feedback flows all ways — accountability you can measure.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative h-[60vh] min-h-[420px] overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-cover bg-center bg-fixed" style="background-image:url('/assets/people-culture.jpg')"></div>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#192e47b3]"></div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto flex h-full max-w-5xl flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 text-center text-white">
    <div class="mb-fade">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.42em] text-white/70">In practice</p>
      <p class="mt-6 text-2xl font-light italic leading-relaxed md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl">&ldquo;Every aspect is tailored to your business's needs — to measure and continually improve performance.&rdquo;</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-primary text-white">
  <div class="mb-grid-overlay absolute inset-0 opacity-30"></div>
  <div class="absolute -right-32 top-1/2 h-[500px] w-[500px] -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full opacity-30 blur-3xl" style="background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(74,111,165,0.7), transparent 70%)"></div>
  <div class="relative mx-auto flex max-w-7xl flex-col items-start gap-8 px-6 py-20 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between lg:px-10 lg:py-24">
    <div class="mb-fade">
      <p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.42em] text-white/60">Get in touch</p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl">Ready to work with a compliance-driven cleaning partner?</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/contact" class="group inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-white px-8 py-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.28em] text-primary transition-all hover:bg-white/90 hover:shadow-2xl">Contact Us <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"/><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"/></svg></a>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

</Layout>